            <div><span class="an-dot" style="background:#ffe8cc"></span><b style="color:#e8590c">Costs high, rent rising</b>&nbsp;— surprises heavy, but rent is growing.</div>
            <div><span class="an-dot" style="background:#e7f5ff"></span><b style="color:#1971c2">Rent stalled</b>&nbsp;— costs low, but rent isn't growing.</div>
            <div><span class="an-dot" style="background:#d3f9d8"></span><b style="color:#2f9e44">Healthy</b>&nbsp;— rent rising and surprise costs low.</div>
